{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "evidenceKind": "three-view-reading-rules",
  "status": "plugin-owned",
  "purpose": "States which source constructs this plugin places in the Data, Function and Business views, which it reads as evidence of a relation or a field, and which it leaves unplaced. A placement is a structural candidate. It is not a transcription of a reference model and it accepts no meaning.",
